102710#issuecomment-2650960968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102710","id":2650960968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eAnRI","user":{"login":"Reneator","id":24807557,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODA3NTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24807557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator","html_url":"https://github.com/Reneator","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T14:18:58Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T14:18:58Z","body":"Also to add: the script error didnt happen for me when doing the same for queue_free.call_deferred()","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650960968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673515567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102710#issuecomment-2673515567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102710","id":2673515567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fWpwv","user":{"login":"rune-scape","id":55224592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjI0NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55224592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape","html_url":"https://github.com/rune-scape","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T05:39:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T05:58:50Z","body":"i finally found the issue:\n`Object::_bind_methods()` registers 'free' specially via `ClassDB::add_virtual_method(\"Object\", MethodInfo(\"free\"), false);`\n('queue_free' is registered by 'Node' via `ClassDB::bind_method()` so thats why it doesn't have the problem)\nthis adds an entry to `virtual_methods_map` that is returned from `ClassDB::get_method_info()`, which `GDScriptAnalyzer::reduce_identifier()` uses to find methods on native classes to turn into callables.\nbut this does nothing when `DEBUG_METHODS_ENABLED` is defined. as it is in template_release.\ni think this might have been an oversight and virtual methods should still be kept in release mode.\n\n~interestingly this isn't related to using `new` as a callable.~\nnvm. this is also the reason `Test.new.call()` doesn't work in release","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673515567/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]